  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zimbabwe - Raspberry and Blue berry plant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With a DGGF Start-up Loan ZMS b.v. will be able to set up a Raspberry and Blue Berry plant in Zimbabwe. Together with their local partner they need to buy plant material and need to invest in capex.These plans have impact on local employment: 59 jobs will be created and an additional 37 jobs for seasonal workers.</narrative>
  </description>
